---
// Kafka Traditional 4-Copy vs Zero-Copy (sendfile) Architecture Comparison Diagram Component
---

<figure class="kzc-diag" aria-labelledby="kzc-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="kzc-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 370"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="kzc-diag-title kzc-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="kzc-diag-title">
      傳統檔案傳輸 vs Kafka Zero-Copy（零拷貝）架構對比
    </title>
    <desc id="kzc-diag-desc">
      展示傳統讀寫需經過 4 次資料拷貝與 4 次上下文切換，而 Kafka 利用 sendfile
      系統呼叫配合 DMA Scatter-Gather 直傳網卡，達成全程留在核心空間的零 CPU
      拷貝。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="kzc-arrow-red"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="kzc-diag__arrow-head--red"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="kzc-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="kzc-diag__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Panel 1: Traditional 4-Copy (y: 20, height: 155) -->
    <g class="kzc-diag__card" transform="translate(25, 20)">
      <rect
        width="830"
        height="150"
        rx="10"
        class="kzc-diag__card-bg kzc-diag__card-bg--red"></rect>
      <text class="kzc-diag__badge kzc-diag__badge--red" x="20" y="28"
        >TRADITIONAL I/O (4 COPIES / 4 CONTEXT SWITCHES)</text
      >
      <text class="kzc-diag__title kzc-diag__title--red" x="20" y="52"
        >❌ 傳統讀寫檔案傳輸路徑（耗費 CPU 與 GC 開銷）</text
      >

      <!-- Flow nodes: Disk -> Page Cache -> JVM Buffer -> Socket Buffer -> NIC -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 68)">
        <!-- 1. Disk -->
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="105" height="42" rx="6" class="kzc-diag__node"
        ></rect>
        <text x="52" y="26" class="kzc-diag__node-text" text-anchor="middle"
          >Hard Disk</text
        >

        <!-- Arrow 1 (DMA) -->
        <path
          d="M 105 21 L 140 21"
          class="kzc-diag__line--red"
          marker-end="url(#kzc-arrow-red)"></path>
        <text x="122" y="14" class="kzc-diag__micro-label" text-anchor="middle"
          >DMA</text
        >

        <!-- 2. Page Cache -->
        <rect
          x="150"
          y="0"
          width="135"
          height="42"
          rx="6"
          class="kzc-diag__node"></rect>
        <text x="217" y="26" class="kzc-diag__node-text" text-anchor="middle"
          >OS Page Cache</text
        >

        <!-- Arrow 2 (CPU Copy 1) -->
        <path
          d="M 285 21 L 330 21"
          class="kzc-diag__line--red"
          marker-end="url(#kzc-arrow-red)"></path>
        <text
          x="307"
          y="14"
          class="kzc-diag__micro-label kzc-diag__micro-label--red"
          text-anchor="middle">CPU 拷貝 1</text
        >

        <!-- 3. User JVM Buffer -->
        <rect
          x="340"
          y="0"
          width="145"
          height="42"
          rx="6"
          class="kzc-diag__node kzc-diag__node--alert"></rect>
        <text
          x="412"
          y="26"
          class="kzc-diag__node-text kzc-diag__node-text--red"
          text-anchor="middle">User JVM Buffer</text
        >

        <!-- Arrow 3 (CPU Copy 2) -->
        <path
          d="M 485 21 L 530 21"
          class="kzc-diag__line--red"
          marker-end="url(#kzc-arrow-red)"></path>
        <text
          x="507"
          y="14"
          class="kzc-diag__micro-label kzc-diag__micro-label--red"
          text-anchor="middle">CPU 拷貝 2</text
        >

        <!-- 4. Socket Buffer -->
        <rect
          x="540"
          y="0"
          width="130"
          height="42"
          rx="6"
          class="kzc-diag__node"></rect>
        <text x="605" y="26" class="kzc-diag__node-text" text-anchor="middle"
          >Socket Buffer</text
        >

        <!-- Arrow 4 (DMA) -->
        <path
          d="M 670 21 L 705 21"
          class="kzc-diag__line--red"
          marker-end="url(#kzc-arrow-red)"></path>
        <text x="687" y="14" class="kzc-diag__micro-label" text-anchor="middle"
          >DMA</text
        >

        <!-- 5. NIC -->
        <rect x="715" y="0" width="75" height="42" rx="6" class="kzc-diag__node"
        ></rect>
        <text x="752" y="26" class="kzc-diag__node-text" text-anchor="middle"
          >NIC (網卡)</text
        >
      </g>

      <text class="kzc-diag__summary kzc-diag__summary--red" x="20" y="134">
        瓶頸：資料兩次進出 JVM 使用者空間，產生嚴重的 CPU 搬運負荷、記憶體放大與
        Stop-the-World GC 停頓。
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Panel 2: Kafka Zero-Copy sendfile (y: 190, height: 155) -->
    <g class="kzc-diag__card" transform="translate(25, 190)">
      <rect
        width="830"
        height="155"
        rx="10"
        class="kzc-diag__card-bg kzc-diag__card-bg--green"></rect>
      <text class="kzc-diag__badge kzc-diag__badge--green" x="20" y="28"
        >KAFKA ZERO-COPY (ZERO CPU COPY / 2 CONTEXT SWITCHES)</text
      >
      <text class="kzc-diag__title kzc-diag__title--green" x="20" y="52"
        >✅ Kafka sendfile() 零拷貝技術（DMA 直接傳輸）</text
      >

      <!-- Flow nodes: Disk -> Page Cache -> NIC (Direct DMA) -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 68)">
        <!-- 1. Disk -->
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="120" height="44" rx="6" class="kzc-diag__node"
        ></rect>
        <text x="60" y="27" class="kzc-diag__node-text" text-anchor="middle"
          >Hard Disk</text
        >

        <!-- Arrow 1 (DMA) -->
        <path
          d="M 120 22 L 175 22"
          class="kzc-diag__line--green"
          marker-end="url(#kzc-arrow-green)"></path>
        <text x="147" y="15" class="kzc-diag__micro-label" text-anchor="middle"
          >DMA</text
        >

        <!-- 2. Page Cache -->
        <rect
          x="185"
          y="0"
          width="230"
          height="44"
          rx="6"
          class="kzc-diag__node kzc-diag__node--green-core"></rect>
        <text
          x="300"
          y="27"
          class="kzc-diag__node-text kzc-diag__node-text--green"
          text-anchor="middle">OS Kernel Page Cache</text
        >

        <!-- Long Direct Arrow (sendfile DMA Scatter-Gather) -->
        <path
          d="M 415 22 L 675 22"
          class="kzc-diag__line--green"
          stroke-width="2.5"
          marker-end="url(#kzc-arrow-green)"></path>
        <text
          x="545"
          y="14"
          class="kzc-diag__micro-label kzc-diag__micro-label--green"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          sendfile() 系統呼叫 ➔ DMA Direct Scatter-Gather
        </text>

        <!-- 3. NIC -->
        <rect
          x="685"
          y="0"
          width="105"
          height="44"
          rx="6"
          class="kzc-diag__node kzc-diag__node--green-core"></rect>
        <text
          x="737"
          y="27"
          class="kzc-diag__node-text kzc-diag__node-text--green"
          text-anchor="middle">NIC (網卡)</text
        >
      </g>

      <text class="kzc-diag__summary kzc-diag__summary--green" x="20" y="138">
        優勢：資料全程留在 Linux 核心空間，省去 2 次 CPU 記憶體拷貝與 2 次
        Context Switch，CPU 使用率極低！
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="kzc-diag__mobile">
    <div class="kzc-mobile-card kzc-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="kzc-mobile-badge kzc-mobile-badge--red"
        >TRADITIONAL 4 COPIES</span
      >
      <h4>❌ 傳統檔案傳輸 (4 次拷貝 + 4 次 Context Switch)</h4>
      <p>1. <strong>Disk ➔ Page Cache</strong>（DMA 拷貝，Kernel Space）</p>
      <p>2. <strong>Page Cache ➔ JVM Buffer</strong>（CPU 拷貝，User Space）</p>
      <p>
        3. <strong>JVM Buffer ➔ Socket Buffer</strong>（CPU 拷貝，Kernel Space）
      </p>
      <p>4. <strong>Socket Buffer ➔ NIC 網卡</strong>（DMA 拷貝）</p>
      <p class="kzc-mobile-note">
        缺點：資料強行進出 JVM，CPU 使用率居高不下且頻繁觸發 GC 停頓。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="kzc-mobile-arrow">VS.</div>

    <div class="kzc-mobile-card kzc-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="kzc-mobile-badge kzc-mobile-badge--green"
        >KAFKA ZERO-COPY</span
      >
      <h4>✅ Kafka sendfile() 零拷貝技術</h4>
      <p>1. <strong>Disk ➔ OS Page Cache</strong>（DMA 拷貝）</p>
      <p>
        2. <strong>Page Cache ➔ NIC 網卡</strong>（<code>sendfile()</code> 觸發 DMA
        Scatter-Gather 直接傳送）
      </p>
      <p class="kzc-mobile-note kzc-mobile-note--green">
        優勢：完全不碰 JVM 使用者空間，省去 2 次記憶體複製與 2
        次上下文切換，達成百萬級 TPS 傳輸！
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="kzc-diag-caption" class="kzc-diag__caption">
    圖二：傳統讀寫 4 次資料拷貝 vs. Apache Kafka Zero-Copy 零拷貝傳輸架構對比
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .kzc-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .kzc-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    background: var(--dg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .kzc-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .kzc-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  /* SVG Base Styling */
  .kzc-diag__card-bg {
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .kzc-diag__card-bg--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.03);
    stroke: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.25);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__card-bg--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);
  }

  .kzc-diag__card-bg--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.03);
    stroke: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.25);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__card-bg--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.35);
  }

  .kzc-diag__badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .kzc-diag__badge--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__badge--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .kzc-diag__badge--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__badge--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .kzc-diag__title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .kzc-diag__title--red {
    fill: #991b1b;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__title--red {
    fill: #f87171;
  }

  .kzc-diag__title--green {
    fill: #166534;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__title--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  /* Flow Nodes */
  .kzc-diag__node {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .kzc-diag__node--alert {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.06);
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__node--alert {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.16);
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .kzc-diag__node--green-core {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.06);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__node--green-core {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.16);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .kzc-diag__node-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .kzc-diag__node-text--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__node-text--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .kzc-diag__node-text--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__node-text--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  /* Connecting Lines */
  .kzc-diag__line--red {
    stroke: #dc2626;
    stroke-width: 1.8;
    fill: none;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__line--red {
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .kzc-diag__line--green {
    stroke: #16a34a;
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__line--green {
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .kzc-diag__arrow-head--red {
    fill: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__arrow-head--red {
    fill: #f87171;
  }

  .kzc-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .kzc-diag__micro-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .kzc-diag__micro-label--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__micro-label--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .kzc-diag__micro-label--green {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__micro-label--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .kzc-diag__summary {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .kzc-diag__summary--red {
    fill: #991b1b;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__summary--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .kzc-diag__summary--green {
    fill: #166534;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-diag__summary--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  /* Responsive Mobile Styling */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .kzc-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .kzc-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .kzc-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
    }

    .kzc-mobile-card--red {
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-mobile-card--red {
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.1);
      border-color: #f87171;
    }

    .kzc-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-mobile-card--green {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.1);
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .kzc-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .kzc-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #dc2626;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #fca5a5;
    }

    .kzc-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .kzc-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .kzc-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.2rem 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .kzc-mobile-card strong {
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .kzc-mobile-note {
      margin-top: 0.5rem !important;
      font-size: 0.8125rem !important;
      color: #991b1b !important;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-mobile-note {
      color: #fca5a5 !important;
    }

    .kzc-mobile-note--green {
      color: #15803d !important;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .kzc-mobile-note--green {
      color: #86efac !important;
    }

    .kzc-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
